      "created_at": "2025-11-08T09:29:15.025Z",
      "cooked": "<p><strong>Why do you need to import existing journal entries?</strong><br>\nOnly import</p>\n<ul>\n<li>closing balances of Balance Sheet Accounts<br>\n<strong>and the things which contribute to them like:</strong></li>\n<li>Outstanding Sales and Purchase Bills</li>\n<li>Unreconciled Entries (Keep them as oustanding only, tip)</li>\n<li>Stock Balances of Items</li>\n<li>Master Data of customer, supplier and employee incase HR module is there.</li>\n<li>Open Purchase &amp; Sales Orders to continue working with flow.</li>\n</ul>",
